      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii__subpara_A",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii__subpara_B",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii__subpara_C"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (a)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii__subpara_A",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "A",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (i), dengan memotong perkataan \"and valuation\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii__subpara_B",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "B",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (iii), dengan memotong perkataan \"and valuation\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii__subpara_C",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "C",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (iv), dengan memotong perkataan \"and valuation\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (b), dengan memotong perkataan \"and valuation\" di mana-mana jua terdapat; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) For the purpose of calculating the customs duty payable, the valuation applicable to any goods shall be made in the prescribed manner.\". Seksyen baru 22c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 22B seksyen yang berikut: \""
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "22c. Where any customs duty is payable by— (a) a company; (b) a firm; or (c) a society, an association or other body of persons, then notwithstanding anything to the contrary in this Act or in any other written law, the directors of such company or the partners of such firm or the members of such society, association or other body of persons, as the case may be, shall, together with such company, firm, society, association or other body of persons, be jointly and severally liable for the customs duty payable: Provided that in relation to a company that is being wound up, the directors of such company shall only be so liable where the assets of the company are insufficient to meet the amount due, after paying any sums having priority over the customs duty under the Companies Act 1965 in relation to the application of the assets of the company in such winding up.\". Pindaan seksyen 102"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 102(2)(a) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"firm or association\" dengan perkataan \"a firm, a society, an association or other body\". Pindaan tajuk kepada Bahagian XII"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Tajuk kepada Bahagian XII Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan sebelum perkataan \"SEARCH\" perkataan \"INSPECTION, INVESTIGATION,\". Seksyen baru 106A dan 106B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan dalam Bahagian XII sebelum seksyen 107 seksyen yang berikut: \" Access 106A. (1) Any senior officer of customs shall for the to places purposes of this Act at all times have access to any place or premises. or premises where an importer carries on his business or where any person who has dealings with such importer carries on his business, (2) Where any senior officer of customs enters upon any premises in accordance with the provisions of this section, then— (a) he may require the importer or the person who has dealings with such importer, as the case may be, to produce any book, data, document or other record, or thing which such importer or person is required to keep under the provisions of this Act, or which relate to any imported goods; (b) he may examine any book, data, document or other record, or thing and make copies of or take extracts from any such book or document; (c) he may seize and detain any book, data, document or other record, or thing if in his opinion it may afford evidence of the commission of any offence under this Act; (d) he may require the importer or the person who has dealings with such importer or any person employed by such importer or person to answer questions relating to— (i) any book, data, document or other record, or thing; (ii) any entry in any book, data, document or other record; or (iii) any imported goods; (e) he may require any container, envelope or other receptacle in any such premises to be opened; (f) he may at the risk and expense of the importer or the person who has dealings with such importer open and examine any package, or any goods or materials, in any such premises. (3) Where the senior officer of customs acting under the provisions of this section is unable to obtain free access to any premises where an importer carries on his business or where a person who has dealings with such importer carries on his business or to any receptacle contained in those premises, he may, at any time, enter such premises and open such receptacle in such manner, if necessary by force, as he may think necessary. (4) Where, on the entry upon any premises under the provisions of this section, any dutiable goods are found in relation to which any offence under the provisions of this Act has been committed, then such dutiable goods shall be liable to forfeiture. 106B. A proper officer of customs shall have all the powers necessary to carry out an inspection and to investigate the commission of any offence under this Act.\". Seksyen baru 111B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 111A seksyen yang berikut: \" Access to 111B. (1) Any officer of customs exercising his powers recorded under sections 106A, 107, 108, 109 and 111 shall be given information or com- access to any recorded information or computerized data, puterized whether stored in a computer or otherwise. data. (2) In addition, an officer of customs exercising his powers under sections 106A, 107, 108, 109 and 111— (a) may inspect and check the operation of any computer and any associated apparatus or material which he has reasonable cause to suspect is or has been used in connection with that information or data; and (b) may require— (i) the person by whom or on whose behalf the officer of customs has reasonable cause to suspect the computer is or has been so used; or (ii) the person having charge of, or is otherwise concerned with, the operation of the computer, apparatus or material, to provide him with such reasonable assistance as he may require for the purposes of this section. (3) For the purposes of subsection (1), \"access\" includes being provided with the necessary password, encryption code, decryption code, software or hardware and any other means required to enable comprehension of recorded information or computerized data.\". Pindaan seksyen 113"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan (c) proviso kepada seksyen 113 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"a female\" dengan perkataan \"another female with strict regard to decency\". Pindaan seksyen 115"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_9__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_9__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 115(1) Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_9__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (b), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \" 128(4)\" perkataan \", or in the event of such amount being forfeited under section 131, as the case may be\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_9__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/10/msa@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (c), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"claim\" perkataan \", or a forfeiture under section 131, as the case may be\". Pindaan seksyen 116"
      }
    }
  ]
}
